const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"Four lobes surround a flower with four petals. The lobes at the sides reach farther than those above and below. A broad arc and two round shoulders close against an inner arc on each lobe. Inside each one sits a narrow band whose arcs widen into rounded curls. Two ruled gaps part each petal from its neighbours, and a short white stamen points away from the round heart.","ja":"四枚の花びらを持つ花を、四つの裂片で囲みます。左右の裂片は上下よりも長く伸びます。各裂片は、外側の大きな弧と二つの丸い肩、内側の弧で囲みます。その内側には、両端が丸くふくらんで内側に巻く細い帯を置きます。花びらの間は定規で引いた白いすき間で分け、円い花の中心から外へ向かって、短い白いしべを入れます。"};

